ist Referral / Escalation"]}]},{"heading":"Medical Ethics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Professional ethics are fundamental."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient autonomy"},{"text":"Informed consent"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Professional boundaries"},{"text":"Beneficence"},{"text":"Non-maleficence"},{"text":"Conflict of interest"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ethical Decision Framework"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clinical Problem","Patient Preferences","Clinical Evidence","Legal / Ethical Requirements","Risks & Benefits","Shared Decision-Making"]}]},{"heading":"Communication Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong doctor needs excellent communication."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"History-taking"},{"text":"Patient education"},{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Breaking difficult news"},{"text":"Family communication"},{"text":"Informed-consent discussions"},{"text":"Interprofessional communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Communication"},{"type":"flow","items":["Listen","Understand","Explain","Check Understanding","Answer Questions","Agree on Plan"]}]},{"heading":"Medical Documentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop accurate documentation skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Important records include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient history"},{"text":"Examination notes"},{"text":"Diagnosis"},{"text":"Investigation results"},{"text":"Treatment plan"},{"text":"Prescriptions"},{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Referral notes"},{"text":"Discharge summaries"},{"text":"Follow-up records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Documentation should be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accurate","Timely","Relevant","Confidential"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Evidence-Based Medicine","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Doctors should combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Expertise"},{"text":"+"}