:"Other physiological indicators"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Telemedicine"},{"type":"p","text":"Enables:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Remote consultations"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Specialist access"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Therapeutics"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology-supported interventions are developing across multiple health conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"Precision Medicine"},{"type":"p","text":"Combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Clinical information"},{"text":"Biomarkers"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Robotics"},{"type":"p","text":"Increasingly used in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surgery"},{"text":"Rehabilitation"},{"text":"Hospital logistics"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By completion of MBBS and required clinical training, the student should ideally have developed:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong medical-science foundation"},{"text":"Clinical examination skills"},{"text":"Structured clinical reasoning"},{"text":"Safe patient-care practices"},{"text":"Basic emergency-care skills"},{"text":"Appropriate prescribing knowledge under professional supervision/training"},{"text":"Patient communication"},{"text":"Medical documentation"},{"text":"Professional ethics"},{"text":"Public-health understanding"},{"text":"Evidence-based medicine skills"},{"text":"Research literacy"},{"text":"Digital-health awareness"},{"text":"Team-based clinical practice"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Professional Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBBS Academic Foundation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Clinical Rotations"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Compulsory Internship"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Clinical Case Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Research / Audit Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Community Medicine Experience"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"BLS / Appropriate Emergency Training"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Research / Publication Exposure"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Health Skills"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MEDICAL SCIENCES"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CLINICAL REASONING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PATIENT EXAMINATION"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"DIAGNOSIS & MANAGEMENT"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EMERGENCY CARE"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PHARMACOLOGY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MEDICAL ETHICS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PATIENT COMMUNICATION"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EVIDENCE-BASED MEDICINE"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PUBLIC HEALTH"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"RESEARCH & BIOSTATISTICS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"DIGITAL HEALTH"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI CLINICAL LITERACY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"TEAM-BASED HEALTHCARE"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for an MBBS graduate entering general medical practice is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Clinically competent medical professional with strong patient-care, emergency, preventive-health, evidence-based medicine and digital-health capabilities.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The professional development pathway should connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Medical Knowledge","Clinical Assessment","Diagnosis","Treatment","Patient Communication","Follow-up","Prevention"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career-Fitment Mapping Note"},{"type":"p","text":"Doctor / Medical Officer is a regulated medical profession. The MBBS pathway should therefore be presented as MBBS + required clinical training/internship + applicable medical registration, rather than treating the academic degree alone as sufficient for unrestricted medical practice. Specialist titles require additional recognized postgraduate training. Exact registration, internship and practice requirements should always be verified against the current rules of the applicable medical regulator and institution."}]}]}